concept:an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-1-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 After subsection 10(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: Customs staff members  (2A) The following are staff members of Customs for the purposes of this Act:  (a) the Chief Executive Officer of Customs;  (b) a member of the staff referred to in subsection 15(1) of the Customs Administration Act 1985;  (c) a person authorised by the Chief Executive Officer of Customs, in writing, to perform a function of a person employed in Customs. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859  Schedule 1  Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity amendments" ;
