concept:an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-31 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31 Multiple amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-31 ;
    values:originalText "The specified provisions of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 listed in items 32 to 114 of this Division are amended by: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859  Proceeds of crime amendments  Schedule 2 Responsible authorities for proceeds of crime: the DPP and the AFP  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 2011          13  (a) omitting “*DPP” (wherever occurring) and substituting “*responsible authority”; and  (b) omitting “DPP” (wherever occurring) and substituting “authority”; and  (c) omitting “*DPP’s” (wherever occurring) and substituting “*responsible authority’s”." ;
    skos:definition "The specified provisions of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 listed in items 32 to 114 of this Division are amended by: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859  Proceeds of crime amendments  Schedule 2 Responsible authorities for proceeds of crime: the DPP and the AFP  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 2011          13  (a) omitting “*DPP” (wherever occurring) and substituting “*responsible authority”; and  (b) omitting “DPP” (wherever occurring) and substituting “authority”; and  (c) omitting “*DPP’s” (wherever occurring) and substituting “*responsible authority’s”."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e08c41a36f147b15d9e701c6c8c166a9df2a8a106a82705bda3b5bf5b60bdbe4" ;
