doc:sch-2-sec-31 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "31 Multiple amendments" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The specified provisions of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 listed in items 32 to 114 of this Division are amended by: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859  Proceeds of crime amendments  Schedule 2 Responsible authorities for proceeds of crime: the DPP and the AFP  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 2011          13  (a) omitting “*DPP” (wherever occurring) and substituting “*responsible authority”; and  (b) omitting “DPP” (wherever occurring) and substituting “authority”; and  (c) omitting “*DPP’s” (wherever occurring) and substituting “*responsible authority’s”." ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer .

