concept:an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-159 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "159 Subsection 4(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-159 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: proceeds of crime authority has the meaning given by section 4C. Note: Section 4C provides for different proceeds of crime authorities in relation to orders under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 and State or Territory proceeds of crime laws. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859  Proceeds of crime amendments  Schedule 2 Responsible authorities for proceeds of crime: the DPP and the AFP  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 2011          25" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: proceeds of crime authority has the meaning given by section 4C. Note: Section 4C provides for different proceeds of crime authorities in relation to orders under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 and State or Territory proceeds of crime laws. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859  Proceeds of crime amendments  Schedule 2 Responsible authorities for proceeds of crime: the DPP and the AFP  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 2011          25"@en ;
