doc:sch-2-sec-210 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "210 Section 4" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Insert: proceeds of crime authority has the same meaning as in the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859  Proceeds of crime amendments  Schedule 2 Responsible authorities for proceeds of crime: the DPP and the AFP  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 2011          33 Note: Under that Act, the proceeds of crime authority is either the Commissioner of the Australian Federal Police or the Director of Public Prosecutions (see the definition of proceeds of crime authority in section 338 of that Act)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer .

