doc:sch-2-sec-243 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "243 Subsection 131(1)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "After “has paid”, insert “before the application for the order is made”. Note: The following heading to subsection 131(1) is inserted “Tax paid before application for order is made”." ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer .

concept:an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-244 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "244 After subsection 131(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-244 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: Tax paid after application for order is made  (1A) The court may, if it considers that it is in the interests of justice to do so, reduce the *penalty amount under a *pecuniary penalty order against a person by an amount that, in the court’s opinion, represents the extent to which tax that the person has paid at or after the time the application for the order is made is attributable to the *benefits to which the order relates." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: Tax paid after application for order is made  (1A) The court may, if it considers that it is in the interests of justice to do so, reduce the *penalty amount under a *pecuniary penalty order against a person by an amount that, in the court’s opinion, represents the extent to which tax that the person has paid at or after the time the application for the order is made is attributable to the *benefits to which the order relates."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6294f8cfead1ecb83390ea380796353f5b212dca1502163eccfe6fd1ee44bb90" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may reduce penalty amount in interest of justice" ;
